      "description": "The City of Brass, a legendary metropolis from the tales of One Thousand and One Nights, was said to lie hidden in the Arabian desert, built entirely from gleaming brass and copper. According to the story, a group of travellers on an expedition to find a trapped jinn reach the City of Brass, only to find it populated by the dead, its brass walls and towers standing as a testament to the vanity of earthly power and wealth.",
