      "id": "Wonder_Capital_Stonehenge",
      "code": "SH",
      "name": "Stonehenge",
      "description": "This prehistoric circle of massive stones has puzzled humanity for 5000 years. Built in stages from 3100 to 1600 BC - it's almost certain that the original idea of its first builders was as unclear to its final contributors as it is to us. It was certainly a burial ground, but what else? A celestial calendar? A healing temple? All we know for sure is that Stone Age builders created something so spectacular, we're still talking about it today.",
